            "review_title": "Review at An Nam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "thanhvy98\n1 contribution\n4\nMemorable birthday party\nOct 2018 • Family\nI have to write a review of An Nam restaurant right now, service in here is very wonderful. Last night was my mother's birthday and i booked a table to celebrate for my mom. Under the light, the color of the dishes became really eye-catching, not only color, the taste of them made me be surprised. Especially, fried prawn with chili salt , it is not too fat , it is very crisp. Morever, it has also vegetables so I'm not afraid of gaining weight. Besides, the waitress is very enthusiastic and friendly. I am very satisfy with An Nam restaurant, i will come back here again\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 6, 2018",
